{
  "nl": "课程管理：查询有课程名称、讲师；表格用两级表头——「课程信息」下分「课程名称」「课时」，「教师信息」下分「讲师」「职称」；支持新增、编辑、删除。",
  "nlEn": "Course management: query by course name and lecturer; the table has two-level group headers — \"Course info\" grouping \"Course name\" and \"Hours\", and \"Teacher info\" grouping \"Lecturer\" and \"Title\"; supports add, edit, and delete.",
  "fixedFields": ["courseName", "hours", "teacher", "title"],
  "pinnedDims": ["propSet", "actions", "columns"],
  "config": {
    "name": "CourseManage",
    "apiUrl": "/api/courses",
    "fields": [
      { "prop": "courseName", "label": "课程名称", "formtype": "Input" },
      { "prop": "hours", "label": "课时", "formtype": "InputNumber", "inQuery": false },
      { "prop": "teacher", "label": "讲师", "formtype": "Input" },
      { "prop": "title", "label": "职称", "formtype": "Input", "inQuery": false }
    ],
    "columns": [
      {
        "label": "课程信息",
        "groups": [
          { "prop": "courseName", "label": "课程名称" },
          { "prop": "hours", "label": "课时", "width": 100 }
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "教师信息",
        "groups": [
          { "prop": "teacher", "label": "讲师" },
          { "prop": "title", "label": "职称" }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "actions": ["add", "edit", "delete"]
  },
  "notes": "AI-09 子项①: groups 多级表头（2 级，跨端安全上限）（vue3/schema）"
}
